OL,3,AUkraine peace talks resume with 'some
OL,4,Aflexibility' by warring sides, US
OL,5,Aofficials say
OL,6,
OL,7,FTrilateral talks between Ukraine,
OL,8,FRussia and the US aimed at ending the
OL,9,Fwar in Ukraine have begun in Abu Dhabi.
OL,11,FAlthough expectations for a
OL,12,Fbreakthrough that ends Russia's
OL,13,Ffull-scale war on Ukraine are low, US
OL,14,Fofficials said yesterday that Moscow
OL,15,Fand Kyiv were privately showing "a
OL,16,Flittle bit of flexibility" on the issue
OL,17,Fof who would control Ukraine's eastern
OL,18,Fregions in a postwar scenario.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
