OL,3,A'There is no justice' - Epstein
OL,4,Asurvivor on how model agency sent her
OL,5,Ato abuser's home
OL,6,
OL,7,F"My agency's job was to protect me, and
OL,8,Fthey failed. In fact, they put me in
OL,9,Fdanger. And for that, they should be
OL,10,Fheld accountable," she tells the BBC
OL,11,FWorld Service.
OL,13,FRoza was 18 when she was first sent to
OL,14,FEpstein's Palm Beach home by MC2 Model
OL,15,FManagement's US branch, having only
OL,16,Farrived in the US from Uzbekistan about
OL,17,Fa month earlier. MC2's US president at
OL,18,Fthe time, Jeff Fuller, now runs another
OL,19,FUS model agency called The Source
OL,20,FModels.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
